# Bandit Level 0

 Objective

The objective of Level 0 is to connect to the Bandit server using SSH.

 SSH Command
```bash
ssh bandit0@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

1.ssh – Secure Shell command used to connect to a remote server.
2.bandit0 – Username provided for Level 0.
3.bandit.labs.overthewire.org – Bandit server.
4.-p 2220 – Specifies port 2220.

Result

After entering the SSH command and the password, I successfully connected to the Bandit Level 0 environment.
